"P3483571709" "Ghost Widow can summon the souls of her victims to do her evil bidding."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1879160615" "{PowerName} drains you for {Damage} points of Negative Energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ethereal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3923775585" "Toggle: Self Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P2473033217" "You can Phase Shift to become out of sync with normal space. Although you do not become completely Invisible, you are translucent and hard to see. You are intangible, and cannot be affected by those in normal space."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Petrifying Gaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P799801114" "Petrifying Gaze"
// Power Help Text :
"P4121526834" "The Petrifying Gaze has stopped you in your tracks!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Obliteration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P663035305" "Dark Obliteration"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2488273493" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P3377894206" "You hurl a large blast of negative energy that violently explodes on impact, exposing the dark power of the Netherworld to all foes near the target. Dark Obliteration can reduce the Accuracy of all affected targets. You must have Gloom or Soul Tentacles before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Black Hole 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P801416744" "Black Hole"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4032697821" "Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P2861448899" "You have been sucked into a Black Hole.  You cannot affect or be affected by anyone in your vicinity."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Etherealise 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3291130400" "Etherealise"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Fall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2272064692" "Shadow Fall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4241292887" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear)"
// Power Help Text :
"P890111217" "Envelops you and your nearby teammates in a shroud of darkness. Shadow Fall does not grant Invisibility, but it does make you harder to detect. Even if you are discovered, Shadow Fall grants a bonus to Defense bonus to all attacks and Resistance to Fear, while reducing Energy, Negative Energy, and Psionic Damage. You cannot use any other Concealment type power while using Shadow Fall. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1701765549" "You hide {PlayerDest} within your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1493333783" "You are hidden within the Shadow Fall."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
"P3802943013" "Avoided"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2430370769" "Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear))"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2614214872" "Shadow Fall has made you difficult to detect, which increases your Defense.  Shadowfall also partially absorbs and deflects Energy, Negative Energy and Psionic damage. You are also less fearful."

