"P78341141" "Hide"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3567599116" "Toggle: Self Stealth, +DEF(Melee, Ranged, AoE)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2100530959" "Hide makes you almost impossible to detect. When properly 'Hidden", a Stalker can pull off Critical hits with his attacks, and even land a massive 'Assassins Strike' with an Assassins power. When you attack or are damaged while using this power, you will be discovered. Even if discovered, you are hard to see and retain some bonus to Defense. Unlike most stealth powers, Hide can be used at the same time as other Concealment powers, giving you even greater stealth capability.  Very low Endurance cost."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4234907424" "You are concealed by your {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1943041994" "Placate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1923307270" "Melee, Foe Placate, Self Stealth/Hide"
// Power Help Text :
"P1540039140" "Allow you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassins Strike. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2833281680" "You have been Placated."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P89862521" "{PlayerSource} has Placated you."

