"P1125963887" "Web Cocoon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2792298988" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -Recharge, -Fly, -Jump, Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P875072192" "The Bane Mace can fire a more powerful version the common web grenade.  The sinewy fibers of this grenade are strong enough to completely Hold one target. Targets able to resist the Hold are still likely to have their attack and movement speed dramatically slowed.  Web Cocoon can also bring down flying targets and prevent foes from jumping. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P827831154" "Hold, -Fly, -Recharge, Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2037126325" "You have been caught in a Web Cocoon and are Held.  You cannot move or fly and your attack and movement speed is reduced."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Widow Training Proxy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3338464623" "Widow Training Proxy"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2278903469" "Arachnos Widow"
// DisplayHelp :
"P23089820" "Characters with Widow Training begin their careers as Blood Widows. Blood Widow characters begin with modest melee, ranged and buff skills.  Beginning at level 24, they may chose to switch to the "Fortunata" path or remain on the "Widow" path and become "Night Widows."  Night Widows gain considerably stronger melee capabilities, and only have modest ranged abilities, while those who go with the Fortunata path learn stronger ranged attack abilities and control abilities."

