"P789809345" "Swipe does light lethal damage to your foe, then poisons them.  The poison does toxic damage over time and slows their recovery rate and movement speed.  NOTE: This power will deal critical damage if used after a successful Placate or while the user is hidden with the Night Widow or Fortunata Mask Presence power.  Damage: Light Recharge: Fast"
