"P363396554" "Ranged, Foe Placate, Self Stealth/Hide"
// Power Help Text :
"P2051459088" "Allow you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also grant you stealth. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P254088221" "You Placate {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1864267621" "You have been Placated and cannot target {PlayerSource}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : NW Tactical Training: Vengeance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P254478779" "Tactical Training: Vengeance"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1099678166" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Teammates +DMG, +To Hit, +DEF(All), Res(Effects)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3625353970" "The loss of a comrade enrages the team. When a teammate is defeated in combat, activate this power to grant you and your teammates a bonus to chance to hit, Damage and Defense to all attacks. A Vengeful team has no fear, and Vengeance protects you and your Teammates from Fear effects. It also gives you and your team great resistance to Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Confuse, Taunt, Placate and Knockback. This power does not stack with multiple castings."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P233225542" "You inspire your team with {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2045516122" "You fallen teammate has inspired you with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P488797791" "+DMG, To Hit, +DEF(All), Res(Effects)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4246625094" "You have been inspired to Vengeance by a natural leader.  Your chance to hit, Damage and Defense to melee, ranged, smashing and lethal attacks are all increased and you are resistant to Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Confuse, Taunt, Placate and Knockback."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1645239844" "You heal {PlayerDest} {Damage} points of damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Elude 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3479477082" "Self +DEF, + SPD, +Recovery, Res(DeBuff DEF), +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P277770895" "You can improve your reflexes, making yourself so quick you can Elude almost any attack, be it ranged, melee, or area effect. Your running speed and jumping height and Endurance Recovery are also increased. Elude also grants you high resistance to Defense DeBuffs. When Elude wears off, you are left drained of all Endurance and unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3331472993" "You are now extremely Elusive, and almost impossible to hit."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
"P4093618625" "Eluded"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Fortunata Teamwork Proxy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P642240050" "Fortunata Teamwork Proxy"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2712942451" "Fortunata's receive advanced Teamwork Training, couple with advanced defensive techniques of their own."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : FRT Mask Presence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : FRT Mind Link 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confuse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3576454646" "Ranged, Target Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P3264723238" "You can Confuse an enemy, forcing him to believe his friends are not who they appear to be. If successful, the enemy will ignore you and attack his own allies. If you Confuse someone before he has noticed you, your presence will continue to be masked. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by a Confused enemy. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3303483100" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} causing them to attack their allies!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3182162719" "{PlayerSource} confuses you causing you to attack your own allies!"
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : FRT Tactical Training: Vengeance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aura of Confusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3147640383" "Aura of Confusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P913165140" "PBAoE, Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P1492151412" "Aura of Confusion can cause chaos within a group of foes. All affected foes within the area will turn and attack each other, ignoring the user and their allies. If you confuse a foe before they noticed you, your presence will continue to go unnoticed. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by confused enemies. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4213198885" "You are confused and may attack an incorrect target."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Kinetic Attack Temporary 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3651790198" "Kinetic Attack"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3412642376" "Self +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P735107825" "Using this power, you can drain the essence of all nearby foes' souls, thus increasing your own strength. Each affected foe will lose some Hit Points and add to your Damage and chance to hit. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Time Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P869452725" "Time Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P53484883" "By gazing into the flow of time you are able to manipulate time itself.  Time Manipulation allows the wielder to inflict crippling debuffs, buff and heal allies and also be able to empower effects on single targets through careful use of Time Crawl and Temporal Selection."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Crawl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2238940030" "Time Crawl"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1722587764" "Ranged Foe, -Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3536371248" "You're able to dramatically slow the time around a single enemy, reducing their movement speed and attack rate.  Time is slowed to such an extreme that their wounds will take longer to heal, reducing their regeneration rate.  Time Crawl applies the Delayed effect on its target.  Debuff and control effects from other Time Manipulation powers are increased on targets affected by Delayed.  Recharge: Long."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P80878853" "-Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3482489949" "Your attack rate, movement speed and regeneration rate have been reduced"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4250415469" "You reduce the attack rate, movement speed, regeneration rate of the target."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2451870868" "{PlayerSource} slows you down to a crawl with their {PowerName}, reducing your movement speed, attack speed and regeneration speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Mending 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P20492702" "Temporal Mending"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562578656" "PBAoE, Ally +Heal, Heal Over Time, +Res(Slow, Regen Debuff)"
// Power Help Text :
"P637007078" "You mend the wounds of yourself and nearby allies by placing your bodies in a past or future state where they are far less injured.  Temporal Mending will immediately heal its targets and continue to heal them for an equal amount over the next 6 seconds.  Additionally, affected allies will gain some resistance to slow effects and regeneration debuffs.  Allies affected by the Accelerated effect will receive additional healing from this power.  Temporal Mending will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1964158182" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2599404221" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1831842746" "Your {PowerName} continues to heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4029204276" "{PlayerSource} continually heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Times Juncture 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1147937862" "Time's Juncture"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2191782139" "Toggle: PBAoE Foe (-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4222109235" "You create a time dilation field around you causing enemies who get too close to be slowed to a crawl, their movement speed, damage and chance to hit will be decreased substantially.  Enemies affected by Delayed have these affects increased.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3595822575" "You reduce the damage, movement speed and chance to hit of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2549879092" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage, speed and chance to hit with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1722386105" "-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P384004502" "The flow of time has been dramatically slowed around the foe using Time's Juncture reducing your damage, speed and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Selection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P492426561" "Temporal Selection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3301978780" "Ally +Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P3815890288" "You distort time around an ally, selecting a period of time where their abilities are at their highest.  Their damage, attack rate and regeneration rates are dramatically increased for a brief period.  This power places the Accelerated effect on the target.  While this is in effect, the target has any healing and healing over time effects from Temporal Mending or Chrono Shift significantly increased.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P170218134" "You significantly increase {PlayerDest}'s damage, recharge rate and regeneration for a short time."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1338077671" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your Damage, Recharge Rate and Regeneration."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P760049584" "+Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2257768674" "Your movements have been sped up as if you're flowing more quickly through time.  You gain a significant bonus to your damage, recharge rate and regeneration."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Distortion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3035182246" "Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2771735844" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe(-Recharge, -Speed), Chance for Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P555632213" "You can choose an area to slow the flow of time down to a crawl.  Enemies who enter the field will have their attack rate and speed slowed dramatically.  In addition, affected enemies might become held as they are frozen in time.  Targets affected by Time Crawl will have the chance to be held increased.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3340992146" "Your {PowerName} reduces your targets' Movement and Recharge Speed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2656174618" "The Distortion Field has reduced your Recharge and Movement Speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Stop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1303004440" "Time Stop"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4217442808" "Ranged Hold, Foe -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3620751643" "You trap your target within the flow of time causing them to be held helpless.  Even those resistant to the effects of Time Stop's hold will still have their regeneration rate and healing effects reduced for a brief period.  Targets affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful hold, however its benefits are brief.  Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2288338409" "Hold, -Heal, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3345956946" "You have been held by Time Stop.  Your healing effects and regeneration rate have also been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3996881439" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} and reduce their healing and regeneration rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P258318004" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName} and reduces your regeneration rate and healing!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1338756627" "Your Time Crawl effect empowers {PowerName}'s hold effect on {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3804716665" "Being Delayed has caused {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} to be more effective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Farsight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2926793761" "Farsight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3803720508" "PBAoE Team, +To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P2293728109" "You give your allies a brief glimpse of the future and what is to come.  This provides you and your team a moderate increase to your chance to hit and defense for a short period of time.   Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3619822295" "You grant your allies the ability to briefly glimpse into the future thus increasing their Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1389102462" "{PlayerSource} boosts your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4278084149" "+To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2593400803" "You have brief glimpses of the future allowing you to predict your foes' movements.  Your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit is increased briefly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slowed Response 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1310678703" "Slowed Response"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3824425035" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Defense, -Resistance"
// Power Help Text :
"P4177343132" "You manipulate time around a targeted foe causing their reflexes to become slowed and sluggish.  This causes them to have decreased defense and damage resistance.  A target affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful effect.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1600483695" "Your {PowerName} reduces the defenses and resistances of your target and nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2407039961" "{PlayerSource} reduces your defense and resistances with their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3877240234" "-Defense(All), -Resistance(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2935672040" "Your defense and resistance has been lowered by Slowed Response."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chrono Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3129124653" "Chrono Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1350508662" "PBAoE, Team +Recharge, Heal, +End, Moderate Healing over Time, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2578936003" "You cause nearby allies to act more quickly by allowing them to slip through the time stream seamlessly.  When Chrono Shift is activated, you and nearby allies will immediately recover a portion of your health and endurance.  Chrono Shift will greatly increase the Recharge Speed of nearby allies for the duration of the power, additionally for a short while the flow of time will constantly undo a portion of your allies' wounds causing them to periodically recover health and recover endurance.  An ally affected by Temporal Selection will recover additional health from Chrono Shift.  Chrono Shift will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P689989828" "Your {PowerName} heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P147486625" "Your {PowerName} restores {Damage} endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P168839769" "{PlayerSource} restores {Damage} endurance with their {PowerName}."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Beam Rifle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P579523066" "Beam Rifle"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2629691664" "Your weapon of choice is a high tech beam rifle capable of firing a wide variety of energy blasts at your foes. Your Beam Rifle attacks will have greater effect while Disintegration is in effect on your target. Beam Rifle focuses on dealing a great deal of single target damage, but has a few area of effect attacks as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Single Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2140791329" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe Knockdown, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P980488966" "You fire a single blast from your Beam Rifle which deals Moderate Energy damage and has a chance to knock the target down.  If the target is suffering from Disintegrate, Single Shot will reduce the target's regeneration rate slightly.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4243055354" "You knocked {PlayerDest} from their feet with your {PowerName} attack!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P434868702" "Your {PowerName} effect reduces {PlayerDest} regeneration rate slightly due to Disintegration."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1124785590" "{PlayerSource}'s Disintegration effect reduces your regeneration rate with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1295646782" "Charged Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2815878953" "Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe Knockdown, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4044724951" "By charging up your Beam Rifle, you're able to launch a concentrated blast of energy at your foe to cause High Energy damage. The impact strikes with such force that it can knock your target off of their feet. Charge Shot causes additional damage if the target is suffering from Disintegration. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1234913844" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} attack for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P935782005" "Your Disintegrate effect causes {PowerName} to deal {Damage} points of additional energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2071389446" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of additional energy damage due to your Disintegrating effect."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cutting Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P290039893" "Cutting Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2096597985" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -Def(All), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P799498896" "You fire a constant stream of energy from your weapon and sweep it in a broad arc blasting all foes in a wide cone in front of you.  Cutting beam deals Moderate Energy damage and reduces the targets' Defense.  This power will cause Minor Energy damage over time if the target is suffering from Disintegration. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P52378253" "Your defense has been reduced by the Cutting Beam!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P15983127" "Your {PowerName} sears {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3469146276" "{PlayerSource} sears you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disintegrate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2034489808" "Ranged, High DoT(Energy), Foe -Regen, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2795346558" "You fire a stream of energy at your foe which causes them to slowly disintegrate and suffer High Energy damage over 10 seconds. Using Beam Rifle powers on targets affected by Disintegrate will inflict additional effects. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2771849471" "Your {PowerName} effect reduces {PlayerDest} regeneration rate."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4171373485" "{PlayerSource} effect reduces your regeneration rate with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aim 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2468750317" "Self +To-hit, +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P1876677102" "Greatly increases the chance to hit of your attacks for a few seconds. Slightly increases damage. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4115236128" "You activate {PowerName} and increase the power of your next few attacks."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1102956951" "You quickly take aim and are more accurate and more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lancer Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P937537777" "Lancer Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3155223699" "Ranged, Superior DMG(Energy), Foe Stun, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2803960760" "You charge up your Beam Rifle and deliver an incredibly focused ray of energy that deals Superior Energy damage and will briefly stun the target.  Lancer Shot will cause additional damage if the target is suffering from Disintegrate.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3540767336" "You have disoriented by the Lancer Shot's impact."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P557326348" "Your {PowerName} pierces {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3205082252" "{PlayerSource} pierces you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2160290682" "You stun {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4062395835" "{PlayerSource} stunned you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Piercing Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4113413988" "Piercing Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2335393485" "Narrow Ranged (Cone), High DMG(Energy), Foes -Res, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1972726495" "You release a supercharged beam in a narrow cone of energy that pierces through up to 3 enemies. Piercing Beam deals High Energy damage and briefly reduces their damage resistance. If a target struck by Piercing Beam is also affected by Disintegrate it will immediately suffer additional damage. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3450006853" "-Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3269849711" "Your damage resistance has been reduced by the Piercing Beam."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Overcharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P148366414" "Overcharge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2319771172" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe Minor DoT (Energy), -Def(All), Disorient, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3834350612" "You overcharge your Beam Rifle and release a massive blast of energy at a group of distant foes causing Extreme Energy damage, causing Minor Energy damage over time, reducing the defense of all affected foes and potentially stunning affected foes.  If Overcharge strikes a target suffering from Disintegrate they will be affected by a much stronger stun.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4162463289" "Disorient, Minor DoT(Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P128734841" "You have been disoriented and are suffering energy damage over time from the Overcharge."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3155730297" "You devastate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduce their defense greatly!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P808108979" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and greatly reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3791667234" "Your {PowerName} causes {Damage} additional energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2927164518" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their Grenade for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brawling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2938953140" "Street Justice"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3815321885" "Brawling"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3810110994" "Street Justice delivers punishing bone crushing attacks that weaken, disable or otherwise hinder their foes. This melee power set has no singular form of secondary effect. Instead, it has many ways to cripple enemies. Street Justice's attack powers come in two categories: Combo Builders and Finishers. Combo Builders add to your Combo Level and thus empower any Finishers you use. See individual powers for how they're improved by Combo Level.  Combo Building powers can provide up to 3 levels of benefits. Build up to the third level before executing a Finisher for maximum effectiveness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Initial Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2767938832" "Initial Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4236187729" "Melee, Light DMG (Smash), Foe Disorient, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P2369376472" "You deliver a pair of lightning fast blows to your opponent in an effort to throw them off balance. Initial Strike deals Light Smashing damage and has a small chance to disorient your target. Initial Strike is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P580006646" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3886663292" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3602669381" "You boost your combo level to 1!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4254141574" "You boost your combo level to 2!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3834265031" "You boost your combo level to 3!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heavy Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1523772661" "Heavy Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3368222246" "Melee, Moderate DMG (Smash), Foe Knockdown, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P3737800714" "You strike your foe with a powerful punch dealing Moderate Smashing damage. Heavy Blow has a fair chance to knock the target off its feet.  Heavy Blow is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1516596182" "You pummel {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3816816025" "You knocked {PlayerDest} from their feet!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Throwing Knives 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P323791697" "Throwing Knives"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P998707922" "Ranged Minor DMG(Lethal), +Minor DoT(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P450282965" "With your natural origin you have to rely on your cunning and skill. You've acquired these throwing knives as part of your personal arsenal. You can throw these knives at a very short range, and deal minor Lethal damage to your target, but a nasty wound will do additional Damage over Time. Damage: Minor (DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1511586969" "You are taking additional Damage over Time from the wound left by the Throwing Knife."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P164978073" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1024540372" "{PlayerSource} hits you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P775112334" "Wounds from your {PowerName} deal an additional {Damage} points of lethal damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2725623310" "Wounds from the {PowerName} deal an additional {Damage} points of lethal damage to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sweeping Cross 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P109148076" "Sweeping Cross"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2859779456" "Melee (Cone), High DMG (Smash), Foe Disorient, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P4037957082" "You execute a sweeping right hook that can strike multiple targets in your frontal arc. Sweeping Cross deals High Smashing damage and can disorient foes. Sweeping Cross is a Finisher and sets your current Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a greater chance to disorient dependent upon the current Combo Level. At Combo Level 3, Sweeping Cross will also have a chance to knock down the affected targets. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combat Readiness 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2897233604" "Combat Readiness"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2390199633" "Self, +Dmg, +To Hit, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P362118892" "Activating this power will increase your chance to hit and the amount of damage you deal for a short amount of time as well as setting your current Combo Level to 3.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P647308172" "You prepare yourself to unleash a devastating attack on your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Throat Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2978963402" "Rib Cracker"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3272980502" "Melee, Moderate DMG (Smash), Foe -Res (All), -Dmg, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P1192951852" "You deftly strike your foe in a very vulnerable location. Rib Cracker deals Moderate Damage but reduces your foe's Damage and Resistance moderately for a short time. Rib Cracker is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2717042964" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage reducing their damage output and damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1350908225" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your damage and damage resistance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spinning Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4288055952" "Spinning Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1836111938" "Melee (Targeted AoE), Heavy DMG (Smash), Foe Knockdown, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P4199344975" "You execute a spinning attack that first strikes with your fist and finally your heel hitting your foe and all enemies immediately nearby. Spinning Strike deals Heavy Smashing damage and has a high chance to knockdown foes. Spinning Strike is a Finisher and sets  your current Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a greater chance to knockdown dependent upon the current Combo Level. At Combo Level 3, Spinning Strike also has a moderate chance to briefly inflict Terrorize in nearby foes. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level.  Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P419999198" "Your {PowerName} crushes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3744035969" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2073040866" "You strike fear into {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2094263606" "{PlayerSource} strikes fear into you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Low Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1060578758" "Shin Breaker"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4142953630" "Melee, Superior DMG (Smash), Foe -Speed, -Defense, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P842572428" "You execute a quick but powerful kick targeting your foe's leg in an attempt to cripple their movement. Shin Breaker deals Superior Smashing damage and moderately reduces your target's movement speed and defense for a short time. Shin Breaker is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1900140634" "-SPD, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3556295630" "The Shin Breaker has reduced your movement speed as well as your defense."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1454251584" "You strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, slowing their movement rate and reducing their defenses!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P984764953" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, slowing your movement speed and reducing your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crushing Uppercut 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1268394429" "Crushing Uppercut"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P58316216" "Melee, Extreme DMG (Smash), Foe Knock Up, Disorient, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P2825194766" "You perform a jaw breaking Crushing Uppercut on your target inflicting Extreme Smashing damage and knocking them into the air. Crushing Uppercut will leave the target disoriented for a short time. Crushing Uppercut is a Finisher and will set your Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a longer disorient duration dependent upon the current Combo level. At Combo Level 3, Crushing Uppercut will have its disorient effect upgraded to a Hold effect. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3109450281" "You strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1416744077" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Titan Weapons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1852466848" "Titan Weapons"
// DisplayHelp :
"P126363283" "You wield an over-sized weapon of some sort; a gigantic sword, mace or axe or possibly even a railroad crossing sign. The weapon's sheer mass gives it great destructive power, and your immense strength and skill allow you to use it as a devastating weapon. Titan Weapons as a set, has exceptional area of effect capability, while retaining a strong single target ability. Certain powers can only be used as follow up attacks and are grayed out when first entering combat, while others allow you to build up momentum and accelerate your attack speed for a few moments."

