"P4212191260" "Mercurial Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P974119330" "Melee, Light DMG(Smash), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P4091448698" "You strike your foe with a lightning fast blow from  your staff dealing Light Smashing damage.  The attack is so unexpected  that the target's defenses are reduced slightly for a short time.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.    Damage: Light, Recharge: Fast"
