// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4059117771" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and slows your movement speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2541951899" "You attempt to immobilize {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
